    "steps": [
      "Combine the yogurt with half the garam masala, half the cumin, and half the turmeric in a bowl; add the chicken and turn to coat. Marinate in the fridge for at least 30 minutes.",
      "Heat the ghee in a large skillet over medium-high heat and sear the marinated chicken in batches until lightly charred on the outside; remove and set aside (it finishes cooking in the sauce).",
      "In the same pan, add the onion and cook until softened, about 5 minutes, then stir in the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute more.",
      "Add the chopped tomato and the remaining garam masala, cumin, and turmeric; simmer for 10 minutes, mashing the tomato down as it softens.",
      "Stir in the cream, bring back to a gentle simmer, then return the chicken to the pan and cook for 8-10 minutes, until cooked through and the sauce has thickened.",
      "Serve hot over the basmati rice."
    ],
