      "Heat half the ghee in a skillet over medium heat and pan-fry the paneer cubes until lightly golden on a couple of sides; remove and set aside.",
      "Add the remaining ghee to the pan, then the onion, and cook until softened, about 5 minutes. Stir in the garlic and ginger and cook for 1 minute more.",
      "Stir in the garam masala, then add the puréed spinach and simmer for 5 minutes.",
      "Stir in the cream and the paneer, and simmer for another 3-4 minutes until heated through and the sauce is glossy."
