      "Shake off excess marinade and arrange the chicken on a rack over a baking sheet, or directly on the grill grates.",
      "Roast or grill for 25-30 minutes, turning once, until charred in spots and the internal temperature reaches 165°F (74°C).",
      "Rest for 5 minutes before serving."
